	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" >Following the 9/04 patch experience for mobs below your level dropped significantly.  It went to about 35% of the experience you were getting on those low dark blue (for level 60 that would be around 46-47th level mobs).<br />
<br />
